  "articleBody": "Cabinet refinishing can refresh sound kitchen or bathroom cabinetry without changing its existing layout. The right choice depends on the condition of the boxes, door style, desired finish, and whether plumbing, electrical, storage, or layout changes are also needed. A clear scope helps homeowners compare refinishing with refacing or replacement before hiring.",
